      "value": "Been happening the last two weeks as described by the OP. I usually get a ping of 180 to US West but with this bug I will either connect with or after a disconnect get a ping of 250. Testing my ping outside of VRChat while this is happening results in a normal result. After another disconnect my ping resets back down. Seems to affect UK and Australian players that I'm aware of.",
