      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also experiencing this issue on PCVR and Desktop modes. in which it results in me losing connection to the server and where I watch my friends point out I've crashed/timeout and I watch my friends continue their conversations or discuss my unfortunate issue until a minute or two later I get \"VRChat is not responding\" OR \"Your connection to VRChat has timed out\".\nI have inspected my cables/switched to wifi, my internet packets and double checked my internet router and lines and this issue still happens. \nI've played this game in this configuration for 2+ years without issues until the last 3weeks/to a month and now this week it has become unplayable to do any activities or have conversations within VRChat due to dropping out. \nI have additionally reset my PC and done a fresh install of just VRChat to determine if any programs/background apps could cause this and within six minutes the issue reappeared.\nI have spoken to other Australian players and friends who also have the same issue as I do but it happens less frequently to them to make a report but for me this makes it unplayable. I dropped out 3 times within five minutes yesterday and totaled 8 disconnects.\nAnd I have timeout 5 times at the time of writing this today.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
