      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is happening to me now. It got progressively worse in december 2022 and on new years eve it became unplayable ever since. Im on quest 2, uninstalled, reinstalled, messed with settings, ping56 to 100. Even hard reset headset, still it occurs. No firewalls, just a tmobile home internet with speeds higher than 50mbps usually. Cant think of what couldve changed except there was an update in december I think, that and a server issues for west coast around new years day that supposedly got fixed.",
